{"2612730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CYBER-ASSASSIN™", "steam_appid": 2612730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the dark, violent world of CYBER-ASSASSIN™ in the <i>Vengeance Demo</i>, an early development showcase of the Cyber-Assassin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/070fd090268badb79a4a7e23d8b36433.poster.avif?t=1782512755\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/070fd090268badb79a4a7e23d8b36433.webm?t=1782512755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/070fd090268badb79a4a7e23d8b36433.mp4?t=1782512755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal Hack and Slash</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience fast, brutal combat inspired by the classic <i>God of War games</i>, <i>Devil May Cry</i>, <i>Ninja Gaiden</i>, <i>Star Wars: The Force Unleashed</i>, and <i>Metal Gear Rising: Revengeance</i>, featuring stylish, violent combos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through a hostile facility filled with deadly enemies, mini-bosses like the Spider-Sentinels, and environmental challenges such as the morgue puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/fd3932637589caa87057b8a56cbfa6ac.poster.avif?t=1782512755\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/fd3932637589caa87057b8a56cbfa6ac.webm?t=1782512755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/fd3932637589caa87057b8a56cbfa6ac.mp4?t=1782512755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vengeance Awakens</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a brutal transformation into a cyborg assassin, Kane awakens with no memories - but his survival instincts remain intact. Trapped in a facility run by the Zenith Corporation, he must rely on his skill, fury, and sheer will to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/305d03e6b72d67955757cf731d7b59e2.poster.avif?t=1782512755\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/305d03e6b72d67955757cf731d7b59e2.webm?t=1782512755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/305d03e6b72d67955757cf731d7b59e2.mp4?t=1782512755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an <strong>early development demo</strong> — visuals, systems, and gameplay are a work in progress and subject to change. Your feedback will help shape the final game.<br><br>© 2026 Isaac Trujillo / CyberWave Studios. All rights reserved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the dark, violent world of CYBER-ASSASSIN™ in the <i>Vengeance Demo</i>, an early development showcase of the Cyber-Assassin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/070fd090268badb79a4a7e23d8b36433.poster.avif?t=1782512755\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/070fd090268badb79a4a7e23d8b36433.webm?t=1782512755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/070fd090268badb79a4a7e23d8b36433.mp4?t=1782512755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal Hack and Slash</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience fast, brutal combat inspired by the classic <i>God of War games</i>, <i>Devil May Cry</i>, <i>Ninja Gaiden</i>, <i>Star Wars: The Force Unleashed</i>, and <i>Metal Gear Rising: Revengeance</i>, featuring stylish, violent combos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through a hostile facility filled with deadly enemies, mini-bosses like the Spider-Sentinels, and environmental challenges such as the morgue puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/fd3932637589caa87057b8a56cbfa6ac.poster.avif?t=1782512755\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/fd3932637589caa87057b8a56cbfa6ac.webm?t=1782512755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/fd3932637589caa87057b8a56cbfa6ac.mp4?t=1782512755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vengeance Awakens</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a brutal transformation into a cyborg assassin, Kane awakens with no memories - but his survival instincts remain intact. Trapped in a facility run by the Zenith Corporation, he must rely on his skill, fury, and sheer will to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/305d03e6b72d67955757cf731d7b59e2.poster.avif?t=1782512755\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/305d03e6b72d67955757cf731d7b59e2.webm?t=1782512755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/305d03e6b72d67955757cf731d7b59e2.mp4?t=1782512755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an <strong>early development demo</strong> — visuals, systems, and gameplay are a work in progress and subject to change. Your feedback will help shape the final game.<br><br>© 2026 Isaac Trujillo / CyberWave Studios. All rights reserved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "CYBER-ASSASSIN™ is a brutal hack and slash game - Raw, violent, and intense. Inspired by classic God of War, Ninja Gaiden, Metal Gear Rising: Revengeance, and Star Wars: The Force Unleashed!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/4d7420533a48e9d6f8310fb29e3e35bee24eb1aa/header.jpg?t=1782512755", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/b53e9415d18285b85f4d23358cfc14ff7b3344f3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782512755", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/b53e9415d18285b85f4d23358cfc14ff7b3344f3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782512755", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</stron